spec: S16-04, S04-16, S06-06, S06-07, S06-13, S02-30

Ticket 16's parity sweep: TTY (`ANNOTARY_TTY=1`, color off) and non-TTY twins for the verbs
no earlier golden ran on a TTY — `thread resolve | reopen | edit | delete`, `delete | restore |
purge`, `member rename | disable | enable`, `token revoke` (`revoke.sh`: the id comes from `token list
--json`), `profile add | remove` — each printing the same fields in the same order
(two spaces vs tabs). Everything here is this group's own (`par-a`, `@par-agent`, profile
`par-p`). Merged stdout+stderr; ids and ages are random.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push par-a.md
par-a	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan thread new par-a --document -m "About the whole thing."
t1	document

$ annotary -p rowan thread new par-a "3:4-3:9" -m "First?"
t2	v1:3:4-3:9 "first"

$ annotary -p rowan thread reply par-a t2 -m "A reply to edit."
t2.1

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan thread resolve par-a t1
t1  resolved

$ annotary -p rowan thread reopen par-a t1
t1	reopened

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan thread reopen par-a t1
t1 was already open
t1  reopened

$ annotary -p rowan thread resolve par-a t1
t1	resolved

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan thread edit par-a t2.1 -m "A reply, edited."
t2.1  edited

$ annotary -p rowan thread edit par-a t2 -m "First, edited?"
t2	edited

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan thread delete par-a t2.1
t2.1  deleted

$ annotary -p rowan thread delete par-a t2
t2	deleted

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan delete par-a
par-a  [..]  deleted

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan restore par-a
par-a  [..]  restored

$ annotary -p rowan delete par-a
par-a	[..]	deleted

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan purge par-a
purged par-a ([..]) — 2 blobs removed
par-a  [..]  purged

$ annotary -p rowan member add par-agent --name "Parity Agent"
@par-agent added: member, grants * (read,comment,action,write)
Token (shown once):
ANNOTARY_TOKEN=ant_[..]

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan member rename par-agent "Parity (renamed)"
@par-agent  Parity (renamed)  member  *:read,comment,action,write

$ sh revoke.sh
[ID]  @par-agent  revoked
token [ID] was already revoked
[ID]	@par-agent	revoked

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan member disable par-agent
@par-agent  Parity (renamed)  member (disabled)  *:read,comment,action,write

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan member enable par-agent
@par-agent enabled; its old Tokens stay revoked — a new one: annotary token mint --member par-agent
@par-agent  Parity (renamed)  member  *:read,comment,action,write

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan profile add par-p --server http://127.0.0.1:1 --token ant_notreal
profile "par-p" saved → [..]/config.toml

$ ANNOTARY_TTY=1 NO_COLOR=1 annotary -p rowan profile remove par-p
profile "par-p" removed → [..]/config.toml

```
